      <p>The <strong>cat logic puzzle</strong> stands out for its combination of zero math, real-time visual feedback, and low stress. There is no timer, no score, no competition — just you and the grid. The cat theme makes it uniquely inviting among <strong>logic puzzle</strong> options.</p>

